# Items whose TITLE matches any line below are skipped: no Claude, no email
# section, and they are marked as seen so they never come back.
# - Plain line = case-insensitive text match anywhere in the title.
# - Line starting with re: = regular expression (case-insensitive).
# Lines starting with # are comments. Remove the # to turn an example on.
#
# - Line starting with category: = matches a product lifecycle item's Category
#   (exact name, or category:re:<regex>), e.g. Accessory, Training, FortiFone.
#   Applies to both new lifecycle announcements and the upcoming-milestones list.
#
#WordPress
#Joomla
#Ransomware
#re:\bApple (iOS|macOS)\b
#category:Accessory
#category:Training
#category:re:^Forti(Fone|Recorder)
